{"id": "4077621e-8e9f-41d1-bb10-bc59ce634b2e", "slug": "modern-cta-section-1", "title": "Modern CTA Section", "description": "Modern Embrace Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Modern CTA Section\"\ndescription: \"Modern Embrace Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#84CC16\"\n  secondary: \"#000000\"\n  accent: \"#4D7C0F\"\n  background: \"#84CC16\"\n  surface: \"#14240D\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Modern CTA Section\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 187; favorites: 10; remixes: 2.\nTags: feature, section, animated, cta.\n## Overview\nModern Embrace Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNx Embrace the next frontier Explore features Launch platform N © 2024 Nexus Systems. All rights reserved. Documentation Changelog Contact DESIGNED BY\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Embrace the next frontier.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #84CC16, secondary #000000, accent #4D7C0F, background #84CC16, surface #14240D, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Modern CTA Section</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #030303;\n        }\n\n        .bg-mask {\n            mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(0,0,0,1) 15%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 65%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(0,0,0,1) 15%, rgba(0,0,0,0) 65%);\n            mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n            -webkit-mask-repeat: no-repeat;\n            mask-position: center;\n            -webkit-mask-position: center;\n            /* Added pulse animation properties */\n            mask-size: 100% 100%;\n            -webkit-mask-size: 100% 100%;\n            animation: pulse-mask 5s ease-in-out infinite;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes pulse-mask {\n            0%, 100% {\n                mask-size: 100% 100%;\n                -webkit-mask-size: 100% 100%;\n            }\n            50% {\n                mask-size: 135% 135%;\n                -webkit-mask-size: 135% 135%;\n            }\n        }\n\n        .data-row {\n            font-family: monospace;\n            letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n            line-height: 1.4;\n            white-space: nowrap;\n            user-select: none;\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(132, 204, 22, 0.4), transparent);\n            -webkit-background-clip: text;\n            background-clip: text;\n        }\n\n        .reveal-wrap {\n            overflow: hidden;\n            display: inline-block;\n            vertical-align: top;\n            padding-bottom: 0.1em;\n            margin-bottom: -0.1em;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"text-white min-h-screen flex flex-col relative overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-[#84cc16]/30 selection:text-white\">\n\n    <!-- Ambient Background Generator (Fixed to maintain alignment when scrolling to footer) -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 z-0 flex items-center justify-center pointer-events-none\">\n        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_rgba(132,204,22,0.08)_0%,_transparent_50%)]\"></div>\n        <div id=\"data-container\" class=\"bg-mask absolute w-[200vw] h-[150vh] flex flex-col items-center justify-center opacity-40\">\n            <!-- Rows injected via JS -->\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Foreground Content Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow flex items-center justify-center relative z-10 w-full py-24 px-6\">\n        <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto w-full\">\n\n            <!-- Premium Icon Element -->\n            <div class=\"icon-reveal opacity-0 translate-y-8\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl p-[1px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#84cc16]/60 via-[#84cc16]/10 to-transparent shadow-[0_0_40px_rgba(132,204,22,0.15)] mb-8 mx-auto group\">\n                    <div class=\"w-full h-full rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-b from-[#14240d] to-[#040803] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-[0.98]\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-[1px] bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-[#84cc16]/50 to-transparent\"></div>\n                        <span class=\"text-[#84cc16] font-medium text-xl tracking-wide\">Nx</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Masked Reveal Heading -->\n            <h2 id=\"cta-heading\" class=\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-tight font-medium tracking-tight text-white/95 mb-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-[0.25em]\">\n                Embrace the next frontier\n            </h2>\n\n            <!-- Action Buttons -->\n            <div class=\"buttons-reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4 opacity-0 translate-y-6\">\n                <!-- Secondary Button -->\n                <button class=\"w-full sm:w-auto px-7 py-3 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-transparent text-white/70 text-sm font-normal hover:text-white hover:bg-white/5 transition-all duration-300\">\n                    Explore features\n                </button>\n\n                <!-- Primary Premium Button with Border Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"w-full sm:w-auto relative p-[1px] rounded-full bg-gradient-to-b from-white/20 to-white/5 overflow-hidden group\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent translate-x-[-100%] group-hover:translate-x-[100%] transition-transform duration-1000 ease-in-out\"></div>\n                    <button class=\"relative w-full h-full px-7 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white/95 text-sm font-normal hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">\n                        Launch platform\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" class=\"text-base text-white/70\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Appended Footer with Aura Profile Asset -->\n    <footer class=\"w-full border-t border-white/10 relative z-10 bg-[#030303]/80 backdrop-blur-md\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-6\">\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#84cc16] to-[#4d7c0f] flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-medium text-[#030303]\">\n                    N\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-white/40 text-sm font-normal\">&copy; 2024 Nexus Systems. All rights reserved.</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-8 text-sm font-normal text-white/50\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Documentation</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Changelog</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors duration-200\">Contact</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Founder Avatar Profile -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <span class=\"text-white/30 text-xs tracking-wide\">DESIGNED BY</span>\n                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/2f563338-39fa-47ea-9761-658d4f3f84db_800w.jpg\"\n                     alt=\"Creator Avatar\"\n                     class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full border border-white/10 object-cover grayscale opacity-70 hover:grayscale-0 hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-300\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- 1. Background Data Matrix Effect ---\n            const container = document.getElementById('data-container');\n            const chars = '010101010189ABCDEFnxai2468';\n            const rowsCount = 35;\n\n            function genString(len) {\n                let res = '';\n                for (let i = 0; i < len; i++) {\n                    res += chars.charAt(Math.floor(Math.random() * chars.length));\n                }\n                return res;\n            }\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < rowsCount; i++) {\n                const row = document.createElement('div');\n                const distFromCenter = Math.abs(i - rowsCount/2) / (rowsCount/2);\n\n                const blur = distFromCenter * 6;\n                const opacity = Math.max(0.1, 1 - (distFromCenter * 0.9));\n                const scale = 1 - (distFromCenter * 0.15);\n\n                row.className = 'data-row text-[#84cc16] text-xs sm:text-sm';\n                row.style.filter = `blur(${blur}px)`;\n                row.style.opacity = opacity;\n                row.style.transform = `scaleX(${scale})`;\n                row.innerText = genString(250);\n\n                container.appendChild(row);\n            }\n\n            gsap.to('.data-row', {\n                x: () => (Math.random() * 40) - 20,\n                opacity: (i, el) => parseFloat(el.style.opacity) * (Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.8),\n                duration: () => Math.random() * 4 + 4,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                stagger: { each: 0.1, from: \"center\" }\n            });\n\n            // --- 2. Masked Word Reveal Setup ---\n            const heading = document.getElementById('cta-heading');\n            const text = heading.innerText;\n            heading.innerHTML = '';\n\n            const words = text.split(' ');\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrap = document.createElement('span');\n                wrap.className = 'reveal-wrap';\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.innerText = word;\n                inner.className = 'word-inner inline-block translate-y-[120%] opacity-0';\n\n                wrap.appendChild(inner);\n                heading.appendChild(wrap);\n            });\n\n            // --- 3. Entry Animations Timeline ---\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                defaults: { ease: 'power4.out' },\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: heading,\n                    start: 'top 85%',\n                }\n            });\n\n            tl.to('.icon-reveal', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            })\n            .to('.word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.08,\n                ease: \"power3.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.8\")\n            .to('.buttons-reveal', {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1\n            }, \"-=0.6\");\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "modern-cta-section-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/modern-cta-section-1.jpg", "source_name": "modern-cta-section-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 256, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T01:20:49.408101+00:00"}